[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3407761770","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111570#issuecomment-3407761770","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111570","id":3407761770,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7LHlFq","user":{"login":"paulloz","id":437025,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNzAyNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/437025?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz","html_url":"https://github.com/paulloz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/paulloz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-15T18:33:23Z","updated_at":"2025-10-15T18:33:23Z","body":"Hello, and thank you for your contribution!\r\n\r\nI don't think this is the right way to go about fixing this issue. We want to avoid injecting `using static` statements into our generated sources, and would rather have the values fully qualified properly. I thought it should already be the case (both for fields[^1] and properties[^2]), so I had a quick glance. It looks like `SymbolDisplayFormat.FullyQualifiedFormat`[^3] does not qualify this how I'd expect because it is missing `SymbolDisplayMemberOptions.IncludeContainingType`.\r\n\r\nI think this is a more proper route to fix the linked issues than adding `using static` statements in the generated sources. It would also be nice to have a new test case covering this, to avoid potential future regressions.\r\n\r\n[^1]: [ScriptPropertyDefValGenerator.cs#L334-L340](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/f192430/modules/mono/editor/Godot.NET.Sdk/Godot.SourceGenerators/ScriptPropertyDefValGenerator.cs#L334-L340)\r\n[^2]: [ScriptPropertyDefValGenerator.cs#L211-L276](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/f192430/modules/mono/editor/Godot.NET.Sdk/Godot.SourceGenerators/ScriptPropertyDefValGenerator.cs#L211-L276)\r\n[^3]: We use it [here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/f192430/modules/mono/editor/Godot.NET.Sdk/Godot.SourceGenerators/ExtensionMethods.cs#L184-L190)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3407761770/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3413436433","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111570#issuecomment-3413436433","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111570","id":3413436433,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7LdOgR","user":{"login":"PavielKraskouski","id":9061796,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNjE3OTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9061796?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PavielKraskouski","html_url":"https://github.com/PavielKraskouski","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PavielKraskouski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PavielKraskouski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PavielKraskouski/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PavielKraskouski/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PavielKraskouski/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PavielKraskouski/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PavielKraskouski/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PavielKraskouski/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PavielKraskouski/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-17T01:20:36Z","updated_at":"2025-10-17T01:33:37Z","body":"@paulloz Hello! Added `SymbolDisplayMemberOptions.IncludeContainingType` instead of `using static` directives. I also discovered and fixed a bug where incorrect code was generated if a static import was used inside an expression. For example, `RadToDeg(2 * Pi)` was generated as `global::Godot.Mathf.RadToDeg(2 * Pi)`. Consequently, the compiler didn't know what `Pi` was. Also added some tests as you requested.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3413436433/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3448572722","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111570#issuecomment-3448572722","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111570","id":3448572722,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7NjQsy","user":{"login":"PavielKraskouski","id":9061796,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNjE3OTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9061796?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PavielKraskouski","html_url":"https://github.com/PavielKraskouski","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PavielKraskouski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PavielKraskouski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PavielKraskouski/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PavielKraskouski/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PavielKraskouski/subscriptions","org